{"ld": 1980, "paper": "SP775", "session": "132", "title": "An Act to Implement the Recommendations of the Stakeholder Group to Examine and Improve the Recruitment, Retention and Wellness of Law Enforcement Officers", "sponsor_id": "s-beebe-center-anne", "cosponsor_ids": [], "committee_code": "CJPS", "committee_name": "Criminal Justice and Public Safety", "summary": {"text": "3248 This bill implements the recommendations of the Stakeholder Group to Examine and 3259 Improve the Recruitment, Retention and Wellness of Law Enforcement Officers. The bill: 1. Creates the Law Enforcement Retention Advisory Council; 2. Requires a death certificate to reflect whether the decedent had previously worked as a first responder; 3. Requires the Board of Trustees of the Maine Criminal Justice Academy to incorporate law enforcement officer wellness training in the basic law enforcement training program; 4. Requires the Board of Trustees of the Maine Criminal Justice Academy to incorporate critical incident debriefing in its training program; and 5. Provides funding for a Maine Criminal Justice Academy Law Enforcement Wellness Coordinator position within the Department of Public Safety.", "official": true, "source": "Bill text, https://legislature.maine.gov/legis/bills/getPDF.asp?paper=SP0775&item=1&snum=132"}, "status": "died", "status_label": "Died On Adjournment", "final_disposition": {"label": "Died On Adjournment", "date": "2026-04-29", "governor_action": null, "governor_action_date": null}, "fiscal_status": "Not Yet Determined", "documents": [{"label": "Bill text (LD 1980)", "url": "https://legislature.maine.gov/legis/bills/getPDF.asp?paper=SP0775&item=1&snum=132", "item": 1}, {"label": "Amendment C-A (S-540)", "url": "https://legislature.maine.gov/legis/bills/getPDF.asp?paper=SP0775&item=2&snum=132", "item": 2}], "amendments": [{"id": "C-A (S-540)", "description": null, "sponsor": null, "status": "Adopted by House & Senate", "url": "https://legislature.maine.gov/legis/bills/get